<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             x:Class="JustAnotherHemaClub.Views.GdprPage"
             Title="GDPR statement">
    <ScrollView>
        <VerticalStackLayout Padding="20" Spacing="14">

            <Label Text="GDPR data processing statement" Style="{StaticResource H1}" />
            <Label Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Text="Last updated: 2025" />

            <!-- Language toggle -->
            <HorizontalStackLayout Spacing="8">
                <Button x:Name="EnglishButton" Text="English"
                        Clicked="OnEnglishClicked" />
                <Button x:Name="HungarianButton" Text="Magyar"
                        Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}"
                        Clicked="OnHungarianClicked" />
            </HorizontalStackLayout>

            <!-- English -->
            <VerticalStackLayout x:Name="EnglishSection" Spacing="10">
                <Label Text="English" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
                <Label LineBreakMode="WordWrap">
                    <Label.Text>
                        Just Another HEMA Club ("the Club") processes the personal data you provide in this app
(name, email, username, training attendance and payment status) solely for the purpose of
running club activities: enrolling fencers, organising trainings, and tracking dues and expenses.

Your data is stored in a private Google Sheet accessible only to the Club's instructors and
to the service account used by this application. It is never sold or shared with third parties.

Photos and videos may be taken of fencers during trainings, sparring sessions and Club
events. These pictures and videos may be used by the Club for marketing and promotional
purposes, including but not limited to publication on the Club's social media channels,
website and printed materials. If you do not wish to appear in such material, please notify
an instructor in writing; we will then exclude you from any media intended for publication.

You may at any time:
  - request a copy of the data we hold about you,
  - request correction of inaccurate data,
  - request deletion of your account and associated data,
  - withdraw your consent to the use of your image in marketing material.

To exercise these rights, contact an instructor in person or by email.

By checking the GDPR box on the registration / profile page you confirm that you have read,
understood and agreed to this statement.
                    </Label.Text>
                </Label>
            </VerticalStackLayout>

            <!-- Hungarian -->
            <VerticalStackLayout x:Name="HungarianSection" Spacing="10" IsVisible="False">
                <Label Text="Magyar" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
                <Label LineBreakMode="WordWrap">
                    <Label.Text>
A Just Another HEMA Club (a tovabbiakban "a Klub") az alkalmazasban megadott szemelyes
adatokat (nev, e-mail cim, felhasznalonev, edzeseken valo reszvetel es befizetesi statusz)
kizarolag a Klub mukodtetese celjabol kezeli: a vivok nyilvantartasahoz, az edzesek
szervezesehez, valamint a tagdijak es koltsegek nyomon kovetesehez.

Az adatokat egy privat Google Sheet-ben taroljuk, amelyhez kizarolag a Klub edzoi es az
alkalmazas altal hasznalt szolgaltatasi fiok fer hozza. Az adatokat harmadik felnek nem
adjuk at, nem ertekesitjuk.

Az edzeseken, gyakorlasokon es a Klub esemenyein a vivokrol fenykepek es videofelvetelek
keszulhetnek. Ezek a kepek es videok a Klub altal marketing- es promocios celokra
felhasznalhatok, beleertve - de nem kizarolagosan - a Klub kozossegi media oldalain, a
honlapon es nyomtatott anyagokban valo kozzetetelt. Ha nem szeretnel ilyen anyagokban
megjelenni, kerjuk, jelezd irasban valamelyik edzonek; ebben az esetben kihagyunk minden
nyilvanossagra szant felvetelbol.

Barmikor jogosult vagy:
  - masolatot kerni a rolad tarolt adatokrol,
  - kerni a pontatlan adatok helyesbiteset,
  - kerni a fiokod es a kapcsolodo adatok torleset,
  - visszavonni a hozzajarulasodat a kepmasod marketinganyagokban valo felhasznalasahoz.

Ezeket a jogokat egy edzonel szemelyesen vagy e-mailben gyakorolhatod.

Az adatvedelmi jelolonegyzet bejelolesevel a regisztracios / profil oldalon megerositi,
hogy a jelen nyilatkozatot elolvastad, megertetted es elfogadtad.
                    </Label.Text>
                </Label>
            </VerticalStackLayout>

        </VerticalStackLayout>
    </ScrollView>
</ContentPage>